text: |-
  5. The necklace and its final position indeed
  proves it was a shaped charge. If Charlie was
  shot in his Cartoid artery then why does the
  link of his necklace break at the point siting
  exactly where his RODE is? Why does
  necklace land on his left shoulder where
  primary point of impact/force originated? If
  3rd law of motion stands necklace should
  have been sitting on his right shoulder. If
  there was a cavitation in his cervicals his
  necklace should have fell forward in front of
  him not towards the entrance wound because
  thats where the strongest force originated.
  This proves indeed the force originated from
  Charlies RODE microphone, it also
  corrobrates the direction the projectile struck
  his cartoid artery from which also
  corrobrates the direction fabric moved in
  which also corrobrates the direction the
  magclip recoiled from. The final part which
  ties all this in is the pendant which was at the
  5 oclock of the shaped charge/RODE
  microphone, due to radial expansion the
  radial force pushed the pendant downwards
  into charlies lap and it behaved like an anchor
  in holding the entirety of his chain on his
  shoulder.
